## Why This Fixes the Error

The Hero component in Astro has **named slots** (`<slot name="badge">`, `<slot name="title">`, etc.) that are designed for this exact purpose. By using `<slot name="...">` instead of passing children directly, you're using the Hero component as it was designed, which fixes the `ReferenceError: Hero is not defined` error.

**Copy this entire code block** and paste it into `src/pages/index.astro`. This will fix the error.